# Plant check: drives off, no friction, brakes or gear damping; the arm
# falls from a raised pose for 0.5 s (J2 swings ~55 deg, the gears run
# through their backlash). Links + rotors + gear springs + gravity keep
# their energy: drift < 0.05 J of ~540 J (arbitrary zero), while the
# kinetic energy reached is tens of J.
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate.arm
@include arm/tests/inc_frictionless.txt
home 0 20 10 30 -60 0
print energy
run 0.5
print energy q
@expect arm.energy[1] ~ 539.3836 0.01
@expect arm.energy[2] ~ 539.3836 0.05
@expect arm.q2 > 60
@reject ^ERROR
